<tr><td width=720 bgcolor="#470000" align="center"><font class="newsheader">Thursday, July 11, 2002</font></td></tr><tr><td><font size=+1 class="newssubject"><strong>Subject: Member Application under construction</strong></font><br><br><font class="newstext">One of the by products of moving the website to a new server is we have to create a new form handler for application submission.  This is currently being done and will be complete soon.  </font><br><br><small>Posted by <a href="mailto:Aknar@crimson-dragons.com">Aknar</a></small><br></td></tr>
<a name="newsitem1026419257,83611,"></a>
<tr><td width=720 bgcolor="#470000" align="center"><font class="newsheader">Thursday, July 11, 2002</font></td></tr><tr><td><font size=+1 class="newssubject"><strong>Subject: CD Website has a new home</strong></font><br><br><font class="newstext">Not sure if anyone noticed but the CD web site has now moved.  By moving our site off of the Nextra Servers we can begin to take advantage of data driven pages like our new roster.  Each of the members now has thier own profile page as well (click on a members name)  In the near future each authenticated CD member will be able to access their characters to make individual updates and changes as they occur, like levels.  You will also find a several sample polls on the award page.  These are just fictious polls and have no merit at the moment and as such I do not reveal the results. But that is possible and you may find a poll coming your way soon.<br><br>These are just a few of the recent changes.  There are many more to come soon.  Including our own chat room hosted by this server.</font><br><br><small>Posted by <a href="mailto:Aknar@crimson-dragons.com">Aknar</a></small><br></td></tr>


